# Add Admin Role & Dashboard to Lost & Found Portal

This plan outlines the steps to introduce an Admin role into our existing system. It handles the database schema updates cleanly, protects administrative endpoints, and provides a backend interface for moderation.

## Proposed Roles

As requested ("if need to add different role tell me first"):
For right now, I propose we add only **two roles**:
1.  **`student`** (Default): The regular user who can post items, edit their own items, and search.
2.  **`admin`**: The moderator who can view all users, delete inappropriate items, and delete/manage user accounts.

*I am using a string-based `role` column instead of a simple `is_admin` checkbox. This way, if we ever want to add a `security_guard` or `teacher` role later, we can do it very easily without modifying the database structure again.*

