## Proposed Changes

### Database Updates
#### [MODIFY] `app.py`
- Update the `User` model to include a new field: `role = db.Column(db.String(20), nullable=False, default='student')`.
- Write a small setup script logic inside `app.py` to automatically create a default admin account (e.g., `admin@college.edu` / password: `admin`) so you can log in as an admin immediately.
- We will add logic to automatically upgrade the SQLite database schema without breaking existing data (adding the `role` column).

### Backend Implementation
#### [MODIFY] `app.py`
- Add a custom `@admin_required` decorator to protect admin-only routes.
- **New Routes:**
  - `/admin/dashboard`: View overall statistics (total users, total items, statuses).
  - `/admin/items`: See a table of all items with options to delete any item.
  - `/admin/users`: See a list of all registered users with the ability to delete or ban them.

### Frontend Construction
#### [NEW] `templates/admin_dashboard.html`
- A specific view layout for admin metrics (cards showing counts).
#### [NEW] `templates/admin_items.html`
- A data table view of all items for easy moderation.
#### [NEW] `templates/admin_users.html`
- A data table view of all users registered on the platform.
#### [MODIFY] `templates/base.html`
- Add an "Admin Dashboard" link in the navbar that only shows up if `current_user.role == 'admin'`.

